WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.040
Strips under a curve. Too big or too small?

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:11.610
Use the left side of each strip on a rising curve, and every strip falls short.

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:15.220
Use the right side, and every strip pokes above.

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:21.013
The true area is trapped somewhere in between: 16.
